Every clinician should offer an evidence-based-medication-treatment for a patient who has an opioid-use-disorder.
If a patient has an opioid-use-disorder and the opioid-use-disorder is moderate then every clinician should particularly offer an evidence-based-medication-treatment for the patient.
If a patient has an opioid-use-disorder and the opioid-use-disorder is severe then every clinician should particularly offer an evidence-based-medication-treatment for the patient.
